1 2 [c] - A Virologist has authenticated themselves within iTrust2. UC2
2 3 [s] hcp A Virologist, a type of HCP, uploads a list of contact data . At any point, the Virologist is still able to re-upload a contact list . Once a list of contact lists has been successfully uploaded, the Virologist may search for n-depth contacts of a source patient and view a list of these contacts along with the contacts' symptom severity level at an indicated time .
3 4 [e] system displays a success message and logs transaction
4 5 [c] System processes request successfully and logs transaction.
